<title>UK: LVMH to arbitration on Guinness.</title>
<headline>LVMH to arbitration on Guinness.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton SA said on Friday it has submitted a request for arbitration from the International Chamber of Commerce over its dispute with Guinness Plc, relating to the proposed merger of Guinness and Grand Metropolitan Plc.</p>
</text>
